{"id":"830fee4940630058","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-tail-shift.md","title":"Cantor 序列的有限尾移","display":"df-tail-shift — Cantor 序列的有限尾移","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-tail-shift","aliases":["20-df-tail-shift"],"display":"df-tail-shift — Cantor 序列的有限尾移","chapter":"11","section":"11.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Theorem 11.3.2 证明中的尾序列","source_printed_pages":[192],"source_pdf_pages":[223],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-tail-shift"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-tail-shift</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tail-shift — Cantor 序列的有限尾移"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.3.2 证明中的尾序列"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>192</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>223</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tail-shift}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tail}_k(X)(n):=X(n+k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tail-shift}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tail}_k(X)(n):=X(n+k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>尾序列可由原序列有效读取；反向只需把固定有限前缀作为常数写入程序。故对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,k\">\\(X,k\\)</span>，尾与原序列等度；该逆转换的有限常数依赖具体前缀。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.3.2 证明中的尾序列；印刷页 192；PDF 第 223 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tail-shift}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tail}_k(X)(n):=X(n+k).","display":true},{"tex":"X,k","display":false}],"bytes":1022,"backlinks":[{"id":"d07bc20b7cf43ad2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-tail-shift]]；see [[20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover]]；see [[20-thm-prefix-product-measure]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435"]}